load @term/seed/code/theory/lattice
  find lattice

# A Heyting algebra: a lattice with an implication operation, the algebra of intuitionistic (constructive) logic, where
# the law of excluded middle need not hold and a proof of not-not-P need not give a proof of P. It is to constructive
# logic what a Boolean algebra is to classical logic, and the kernel's proof-relevant logic is constructive in this
# spirit. The form carries the underlying lattice; the implication is the added operation.
form heyting-algebra
  link lattice, like lattice
